===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Rhyhorn|93}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion; both cards have the Horn Attack attack.
*{{m|Horn Attack}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Rhyhorn}} can learn.
